#. L_TRA_004
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_TRA_005
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_TRA_006
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_TRA_007
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_TRA_008
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_TRA_009
msgid "Locate alien tech medpack\n"
msgstr "自動手術装置を発見せよ\n"

#. L_TRA_010
msgid "Rendezvous with CI spy\n"
msgstr "ジョナサンと合流せよ\n"

#. L_TRA_011
msgid "Revive Maian Bodyguard\n"
msgstr "マイアンを目覚めさせよ\n"

#. L_TRA_012
msgid "Locate secret hangar\n"
msgstr "秘密格納庫へ侵入せよ\n"

#. L_TRA_013
msgid "Escape from Area 51\n"
msgstr "エリア５１から脱出せよ\n"

#. L_TRA_014
msgid "Joanna - this is Jonathan. You're in grave danger.\n"
msgstr ""
"こちらジョナサンだ。\n"
"ずいぶんトラブっているようだな。\n"

#. L_TRA_015
msgid "They've flooded the area with nerve gas.\n"
msgstr "見ろよ、ガスの海だぜ。\n"

#. L_TRA_016
msgid ""
"Get our friend to the containment lab. \n"
"There's a hiding place there.\n"
msgstr "まず「フレンド」を倉庫エリアに運ぶんだ。\n"

#. L_TRA_017
msgid "I'll contact you when you get there - good luck!\n"
msgstr "どこかに隠し場所があるだろう。では後で…\n"

#. L_TRA_018
msgid ""
"Good work, Jo. We need to meet up. They're \n"
"getting suspicious of me.\n"
msgstr "いいぞジョアンナ、次はオレたちが合流だ。\n"

#. L_TRA_019
msgid ""
"Use the maintenance hatch I've opened \n"
"in one of the containment labs. Hurry.\n"
msgstr "こっちのエリアへのドアロックを開けておいた。急げ！\n"

#. L_TRA_020
msgid "Obtain alien medpack.\n"
msgstr "Obtain alien medpack.\n"

#. L_TRA_021
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries'\n"

#. L_TRA_022
msgid "Alien medpack\n"
msgstr "オートオペ\n"

#. L_TRA_023
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. L_TRA_024
msgid "Picked up an alien medpack.\n"
msgstr "オートオペを手に入れた\n"

#. L_TRA_025
msgid "Joanna - over here.\n"
msgstr "ジョアンナ、こっちだ！\n"

#. L_TRA_026
msgid "We need to get back to our friend.\n"
msgstr "「フレンド」のところへ戻らなきゃな。\n"

#. L_TRA_027
msgid "Right, we're near. Cover me, Jo...\n"
msgstr ""
"よし、オレがここを爆破する。\n"
"ジョアンナ、カバーしてくれ！\n"

#. L_TRA_028
msgid "Okay - stand back.\n"
msgstr "ＯＫ、下がってくれ。\n"

#. L_TRA_029
msgid "Jonathan has been killed.\n"
msgstr "ジョナサンが倒された\n"

#. L_TRA_030
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\n"
msgstr "エルビスが倒された\n"

#. L_TRA_031
msgid "The secret hangar has been located.\n"
msgstr "秘密格納庫への侵入完了\n"

#. L_TRA_032
msgid "Okay, Jo - let's go.\n"
msgstr "ＯＫ、ジョアンナ。行こう！\n"

#. L_TRA_033
msgid "Alien medpack activated.\n"
msgstr "オートオペ起動\n"

#. L_TRA_034
msgid "Alien medpack operation aborted.\n"
msgstr "オートオペの機能が停止した\n"

#. L_TRA_035
msgid "Alien medpack has been administered.\n"
msgstr "オートオペ作業完了\n"

#. L_TRA_036
msgid "Mission critical object destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. L_TRA_037
msgid "Outer hangar door is opening.\n"
msgstr "格納庫の外部ハッチが開いた\n"

#. L_TRA_038
msgid "Outer hangar door is closing.\n"
msgstr "格納庫の外部ハッチが閉ざされた\n"

#. L_TRA_039
msgid "Inner hangar door is opening.\n"
msgstr "格納庫の内部ハッチが開いた\n"

#. L_TRA_040
msgid "Inner hangar door is closing.\n"
msgstr "格納庫の内部ハッチが閉ざされた\n"

#. L_TRA_041
msgid "It's the only way out of here.\n"
msgstr "他に脱出する方法はないわ。\n"

#. L_TRA_042
msgid "You're the only one who can fly it, Elvis, so get in.\n"
msgstr "操縦できるのはアンタだけよ、早く乗って！\n"

#. L_TRA_043
msgid "But we can't leave you behind.\n"
msgstr "あなたをここに置いては行けないわ。\n"

#. L_TRA_044
msgid "There must be a way out of here.\n"
msgstr "出口は他にもあるはずだから…。\n"

#. L_TRA_045
msgid ""
"One of us will have to stay behind and open the \n"
"hangar doors.\n"
msgstr ""
"ジョアンナ、オレたちのどちらかがここに残って\n"
"格納庫のハッチを開ける必要があるな。\n"

#. L_TRA_046
msgid ""
"I'll get out on that hoverbike. Cover me while I \n"
"open the doors.\n"
msgstr ""
"オレは後であのホバーバイクで外に出よう。\n"
"ハッチを開けるから、その間援護してくれ。\n"

#. L_TRA_047
msgid "Jonathan, go with Elvis. I'll see to the consoles.\n"
msgstr ""
"ジョナサン、エルビスと脱出して！\n"
"私がハッチを開けるわ\n"

#. L_TRA_048
msgid "It's dangerous, Jo...\n"
msgstr "危険だぞ、ジョアンナ…\n"

#. L_TRA_049
msgid "I can handle it... Trust me.\n"
msgstr "できるわ…　私を信じて。\n"

#. L_TRA_050
msgid "...Okay.\n"
msgstr "…ＯＫ。\n"

#. L_TRA_051
msgid "Damn it, Joanna... cover me!\n"
msgstr "クソ…　ジョアンナ、援護を頼む！\n"

#. L_TRA_052
msgid "I'll cover the stairs - you take the ramp.\n"
msgstr "I'll cover the stairs - you take the ramp.\n"

#. L_TRA_053
msgid "The hangar doors are now open.\n"
msgstr "格納庫のハッチが開いた\n"

#. L_TRA_054
msgid "Medical containment doors unlocked.\n"
msgstr "医務備品室のドアが開いた\n"

#. L_TRA_055
msgid "The medpack's got to be somewhere around here.\n"
msgstr ""
"マイアンの自動手術装置は\n"
"きっとこの辺にあるはずだわ…\n"

#. L_TRA_056
msgid ""
"Time to hook up with Jonathan, before he gets \n"
"into any more trouble.\n"
msgstr ""
"急いでジョナサンと合流しなきゃ。\n"
"アイツ困ってるみたいだし…\n"

#. L_TRA_057
msgid ""
"That smell... oil... I smelt that in the other \n"
"hangars.\n"
msgstr ""
"このニオイは…　オイルね。\n"
"向こうの格納庫と同じニオイだわ\n"

#. L_TRA_058
msgid ""
"The jetbike should get me out before they lock \n"
"the base down.\n"
msgstr ""
"ヤツらが基地をロックしてしまう前に\n"
"ジェットバイクで逃げなきゃ。\n"

#. L_TRA_059
msgid "Oh, no! We have a problem. It's a single seater!\n"
msgstr "うーん、しまった！これは１人乗りなんだ。\n"

#. L_TRA_060
msgid "Two can get in but no more.\n"
msgstr "２人は乗れるけど、それ以上はムリだ。\n"

#. L_TRA_061
msgid "Plus, it's got no style, you know what I'm saying?\n"
msgstr "地球はレディファーストだ、ミーは後で…\n"

#. L_TRA_062
msgid ""
"I'm not having this. That specimen is government property and should not "
"leave the base.\n"
msgstr ""
"これはオレたちのものじゃない。政府の重要\n"
"機密だ。外には絶対出してはいけないんだ。\n"

#. L_TRA_063
msgid ""
"Let's see how that overconfident thief deals with our gas defense system. "
"She'll think twice before messing with me again!\n"
msgstr ""
"開き直りやがって。みてろよ！\n"
"ガスのエジキになるがいい。\n"
"pこれで２度とあんなマネは\n"
"できないはずだ！\n"

#. L_TRA_064
msgid "What's that noise? Can't be... Gas!\n"
msgstr "何、この音？　まさか…ガス？\n"

#. L_TRA_065
msgid "Noooo, that wasn't meant to happen!\n"
msgstr "ギエーーー、こんなハズじゃなかった！\n"

#. L_TRA_066
msgid "Please stop! I'm not supposed to die. She... Arggghhh!\n"
msgstr ""
"頼む、止まってくれ！オレが死んでどうする\n"
"んだ！アイツだろ、グワワ！\n"

#. L_TRA_067
msgid "You idiot! We'd better get out of here.\n"
msgstr "何て…。　早くここを出なきゃ！\n"

#. L_TRA_068
msgid "Gasps, chokes, and wheezes.\n"
msgstr "ゴホ、ゲホ…\n"

#. L_TRA_069
msgid "***aahh...! aahaa...! aaaaahhh!  aha.  ahh.***\n"
msgstr "ウワアアアー！！\n"

#. L_TRA_070
msgid ""
"I'm alive. I thought I'd be chopped up like the others by now. You're from "
"the Institute, aren't you? I recognize you from before. You helped me. Thank"
" you.\n"
msgstr ""
"生きてる…。\n"
"もうダメだと思ってたよ。\n"
"pユーはキャリントン協会の人だろ？\n"
"助けてくれたんだね、サンキュー。\n"

#. L_TRA_071
msgid "You... You speak our language?\n"
msgstr "あなた、地球の言葉をしゃべるのね？\n"

#. L_TRA_072
msgid "Watch her... she's sharp.\n"
msgstr "彼女には逆らわないほうが…\n"

#. L_TRA_073
msgid "Earrggghh...eerggh...\n"
msgstr "アテテテテテ…　ウググ…\n"

#. L_TRA_074
msgid "What's wrong?\n"
msgstr "大丈夫？\n"

#. L_TRA_075
msgid "I have a headache. And with a head this big, that's no joke.\n"
msgstr ""
"頭が…、割れそうだ。\n"
"シャレになんないよ、全く。\n"

#. L_TRA_076
msgid ""
"Can you walk? We must leave before they get organized and hunt us down.\n"
msgstr ""
"歩ける？　警備兵が来る前に\n"
"逃げなきゃならないわ。\n"

#. L_TRA_077
msgid "I think so. What's your name?\n"
msgstr "多分大丈夫さ。ユーの名前は？\n"

#. L_TRA_078
msgid "I'm Agent Dark. Or Joanna, if you prefer.\n"
msgstr ""
"私はエージェント・ダーク。\n"
"でも、ジョアンナでいいわ。\n"

#. L_TRA_079
msgid "Well, Joanna, I'm Protector One. But you can call me... Elvis!\n"
msgstr ""
"ＯＫ、ジョアンナ。ミーはプロテクター１。\n"
"でも…「エルビス」って呼んでくれ。\n"

#. L_TRA_080
msgid "Console is not active.\n"
msgstr "コンソールは稼動していません\n"

#. L_TRA_081
msgid ""
"What the hell do you think you're doing? \n"
"This is supposed to be a sealed room! \n"
"Don't you know anything about autopsy \n"
"procedures?\n"
msgstr ""
"一体何のマネだ？　ここは\n"
"超極秘エリアなんだぞ！！\n"
"p検死の手続きを知らないのか！\n"

#. L_TRA_082
msgid ""
"Director Easton will hear about this, \n"
"young lady.\n"
msgstr ""
"イーストン司令にバレたら\n"
"タダでは済まないぞ！\n"

#. L_TRA_083
msgid ""
"You can't take that! It's government property! \n"
"This is intolerable! It's... it's... \n"
"unprofessional!!\n"
msgstr ""
"オイ！　政府の重要機密なんだぞ！\n"
"何てことだ。ガマンならない…\n"

#. L_TRA_084
msgid "I don't care much for procedures!\n"
msgstr "私、「手続き」ってキライなの！\n"
